TITLE Calcite kinetics in acidic Cu-Ba solution at 200 C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2
    pe 4
    redox pe
    units mmol/kgw
    Cu 10
    Ba 5
    water 1
RATES
Calcite
-start
10 moles = 0
20 if (M <= 0) then goto 200
30 sa = PARM(1)
40 k = PARM(2)
50 rate = k * sa
60 moles = rate * TIME
70 if (moles > M) then moles = M
200 SAVE moles
-end
KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0 1
        -m 1
        -parms 1.0 10
    -steps 1000 in 100 steps
END
